{"ticker":"GPC","updated":"2026-10-23T23:02:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Genuine Parts Company","shortName":"Genuine Parts Company","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.genpt.com","fullTimeEmployees":65000,"marketCap":16959507456,"trailingPE":473.15384,"forwardPE":15.072655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.6694733,"pegRatio":1.32,"targetMeanPrice":140.0,"targetHighPrice":170.0,"targetLowPrice":122.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":9,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.042,"earningsGrowth":0.0,"grossMargins":0.37744,"operatingMargins":0.06364,"profitMargins":0.00123,"totalRevenue":25332613120,"beta":0.677,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":151.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.32},"summary":"Genuine Parts Company distributes automotive and industrial replacement parts. The company operates in three segments: North America Automotive Parts Group, International Automotive Parts Group, and Industrial Parts Group. It distributes automotive replacement parts, accessories, tools, equipment, and related solutions for hybrid and electric vehicles, trucks, buses, motorcycles, farm equipment, and heavy-duty equipment. The company also offers replacement parts, including brakes, batteries, filters, engine components, and fluids; specialized services, such as paint mixing, hydraulic hose assembly, battery testing, and key cutting; and accessories and specialty equipment for automotive and heavy-duty vehicles, as well as tools and diagnostic devices for repair and maintenance. In addition, it provides independent repair shops and auto care centers under the NAPA brand, and offers technical expertise and training programs to customers. Further, the company provides bearings, seals, and gaskets; hose, fittings, hydraulics, and pneumatics components; abrasives, adhesives, sealants, and tape; pumps and power transmission; tools and testing equipment; electrical supplies and safety products; and chemicals and janitorial supplies. Additionally, it offers inventory management; vendor-managed inventory; asset repair and tracking, including radio frequency identification; and specialize","summary_zh":"原廠零件公司經銷汽車和工業替換零件。該公司分為三個部門：北美汽車零件集團、國際汽車零件集團和工業零件集團。該公司分銷汽車替換零件、配件、工具、設備以及混合動力和電動汽車、卡車、巴士、摩托車、農業設備和重型設備的相關解決方案。該公司還提供替換零件，包括煞車、電池、過濾器、引擎部件和液體；專業服務，例如油漆混合、液壓軟管組裝、電池測試和鑰匙切割；汽車和重型車輛的配件和專用設備，以及用於維修和保養的工具和診斷設備。此外，它還以NAPA品牌提供獨立的維修店和汽車護理中心，並為客戶提供技術專業知識和培訓計劃。此外，該公司還提供軸承、密封件和墊片；軟管、接頭、液壓和氣動元件；磨料、黏合劑、密封劑和膠帶；泵浦和動力傳輸；工具和檢測設備；電力供應和安全產品；以及化學品和清潔用品。此外，它還提供庫存管理；供應商管理的庫存；資產修復和跟踪，包括無線射頻識別；並專注於","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":138.86,"h":139.61,"l":138.27,"c":139.25,"v":791800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":139.4,"h":140.66,"l":138.66,"c":138.75,"v":859900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":138.94,"h":140.02,"l":138.3,"c":139.85,"v":1924200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":140.0,"h":140.0,"l":138.41,"c":139.31,"v":755700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":139.94,"h":140.49,"l":138.67,"c":139.33,"v":675900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":138.59,"h":139.18,"l":136.03,"c":136.03,"v":1022300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":136.12,"h":136.86,"l":135.23,"c":136.27,"v":711200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":142.75,"h":143.48,"l":137.24,"c":141.25,"v":3464900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":140.45,"h":142.16,"l":138.06,"c":139.5,"v":2049900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":139.06,"h":140.08,"l":137.74,"c":139.85,"v":1480900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":139.33,"h":139.74,"l":137.57,"c":138.95,"v":1019300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":138.28,"h":139.73,"l":138.01,"c":139.49,"v":1825100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":139.79,"h":143.1,"l":138.74,"c":142.77,"v":1125900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":141.74,"h":142.5,"l":140.6,"c":141.28,"v":856700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":141.04,"h":141.04,"l":138.98,"c":139.04,"v":1454500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":140.05,"h":140.74,"l":138.91,"c":139.63,"v":1884900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":140.12,"h":142.11,"l":139.05,"c":139.23,"v":1693600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":138.45,"h":139.6,"l":137.57,"c":137.91,"v":952400},{"